pA&oe=6AA696D1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "V8 Engine Simulation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock the mysteries of automotive engineering with our cutting-edge V8 Engine Training Simulator. Immerse yourself in a virtual world where learning meets hands-on experience, allowing enthusiasts, students, and professionals to grasp the intricacies of V8 engine assembly like never before.\n\nPowered by state-of-the-art technology, our simulator utilises a real V8 engine model, providing an authentic and comprehensive learning experience. Whether you're a novice eager to explore the mechanics or a seasoned automotive enthusiast aiming to enhance your knowledge, our simulator caters to all skill levels.\n\nKey Features:\n\n1. Real Engine Integration: Our simulator boasts a genuine V8 engine, enabling users to interact with real components and understand their functions.\n\n2. Interactive Learning Modules: Dive into an array of interactive modules that cover every aspect of V8 engine assembly, from identifying parts to mastering the intricacies of fuel injection systems.\n\n3. Real-Time Feedback: Receive instant feedback on your assembly progress, allowing for continuous improvement and a deeper understanding of the engine's inner workings.\n\n4. Step-by-Step Tutorials: Guided by detailed step-by-step tutorials, users can progress at their own pace, ensuring a thorough grasp of each assembly stage.\n\n\n\n\nUnleash your passion for engines and master the art of V8 assembly like never before!\n", "short_description": "Discover the art of V8 engine assembly with our state-of-the-art Training Simulator! Featuring a real V8 engine, interactive modules, and step-by-step tutorials, our simulator caters to all skill levels. Gain hands-on experience, receive real-time feedback, and master the intricacies of automotive engineering. Elevate your knowledge with our immersive and authentic V8 Engine Training Simulator today! \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pastelcube.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pastelcube Technologies private limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.pastelcube.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24437112279225159"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1558847994878303"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1558847994878303"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1747990920, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1558847994878303"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24420261670910220", "version": "0.1.0"}, "id": "1414430369282221", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7771662346196748", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "24420261670910220"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1414430369282221"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1747647885, "id": "24420261